WEBVTT

00:32:59.246 --> 00:33:00.871
What we see when we do that is that

00:33:00.871 --> 00:33:05.038
the lessons we learn in these hard times
will shape our jobs and our cultures

00:33:05.079 --> 00:33:08.579
for the long haul. Some of those
effects are negative

00:33:08.829 --> 00:33:14.121
and we have to be vigilant to counteract.
Some of them are surprisingly positive.

00:33:14.621 --> 00:33:16.579
A glimmer of light up ahead.

00:33:20.246 --> 00:33:21.954
We also see that in the bumpiest

00:33:21.954 --> 00:33:26.038
or most chaotic moments are connections
with each other are more important than

00:33:26.038 --> 00:33:30.454
ever, and it's up to us to be proactive
about not only reaching out to our